ed October 17, 2025.", "source_name": "PaloAlto ContagiousInterview BeaverTail InvisibleFerret November 2023", "url": "https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/two-campaigns-by-north-korea-bad-actors-target-job-hunters/"}, {"description": "Unit42. (2024, October 9). Contagious Interview: DPRK Threat Actors Lure Tech Industry Job Seekers to Install New Variants of BeaverTail and InvisibleFerret Malware. Retrieved October 17, 2025.", "source_name": "PaloAlto Unit42 ContagiousInterview BeaverTail InvisibileFerret October 2024", "url": "https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/north-korean-threat-actors-lure-tech-job-seekers-as-fake-recruiters/"}], "id": "relationship--147c6a91-6bf4-458f-94ba-bdb950ecd3bb", "modified": "2026-07-31T18:47:54.396Z", "object_marking_refs": ["marking-definition--fa42a846-8d90-4e51-bc29-71d5b4802168"], "relationship_type": "uses", "revoked": false, "source_ref": "intrusion-set--46599a4a-77ee-4697-9474-2683b6464859", "spec_version": "2.1", "target_ref": "attack-pattern--d4287702-e2f7-4946-bdfa-2c7f5aaa5032", "type": "relationship", "x_mitre_attack_spec_version": "3.3.0", "x_mitre_deprecated": false, "x_mitre_modified_by_ref": "identity--c78cb6e5-0c4b-4611-8297-d1b8b55e40b5"}', 'kb-doc-09-mitre-attack-p0-9713', 0, 233, '09-mitre-attack', 'retrieved', 'C5A7D05CED1A5D530A027C8EB16350527216846E9931DFAD290C4FB748536C41', 'v1', '{"source_id": "09-mitre-attack", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "STRUCTURED_DATA"}')
